                </div>
                <div class="font-mono text-xs">
                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{"}"}
                </div>
                <div class="font-mono text-xs">&nbsp;&nbsp;{"}"}</div>
                <div class="font-mono text-xs">{"}"}</div>
                <div class="text-xs mt-1 text-gray-400">
                    <Mark type="yes" /> Retries only errors that can succeed later
                </div>
            </div>
        </ProTip>

        <ProTip>
            <div><Mark type="warn" /> <strong>Best practices:</strong></div>
            <div class="pl-2 border-l border-rule space-y-0.5 mt-1">
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="text-green-400"><Mark type="yes" /></span> Use exponential backoff
                    for API calls
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="text-green-400"><Mark type="yes" /></span> Don't retry 4xx errors (client errors)
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="text-green-400"><Mark type="yes" /></span> Retry 5xx errors, timeouts and network errors
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="text-green-400"><Mark type="yes" /></span> Log each retry attempt
                    with context
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="text-green-400"><Mark type="yes" /></span> Set a retry limit (3 to 5 attempts)
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="text-yellow-400"></span> Add jitter (a random delay) so clients don't all retry at once
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="text-red-400"><Mark type="no" /></span> Don't retry forever (it overloads the server)
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs">
                    <span class="text-red-400"><Mark type="no" /></span> Don't retry non-idempotent operations, such as a payment <code>POST</code>
                </div>
            </div>
        </ProTip>
